			dependencies: ["134D9801D13D58F5"]
			description: [
				"During &6Cisco's &fjourney to the &5fallen realm &fin search of a way to defeat &4the Fell King &fhe stumbled upon &4Arthas' &fsoldiers mining a mysterious &0dark crystal. &fUpon thorough examination it dawned on him that it was indeed the source of &4Arthas' &fimmense &cpower."
				""
